<section aria-label="Knee stem cell therapy at a glance" id="at-a-glance" style="background:var(--paper);padding:clamp(56px,6vw,88px) 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line-on-light)">
<div class="sc-responsive-shell">
<div class="sc-glance-heading-grid" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,.72fr) minmax(0,1.28fr);gap:clamp(32px,5vw,72px);align-items:end;margin-bottom:clamp(30px,4vw,46px)">
<div>
<span style="display:block;font-size:11px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:var(--ls-eyebrow);text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--sand-700);margin-bottom:16px">Knee stem cell therapy at a glance</span>
<p style="margin:0;max-width:40ch;font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--text-on-light-secondary)">If you remember only four things before comparing treatment proposals, make them these.</p>
</div>
<h2 style="margin:0;font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:400;font-size:clamp(38px,4.6vw,60px);line-height:1.02;letter-spacing:-.02em;color:var(--ink-950)">The Four Things Worth Knowing Before You Compare Clinics</h2>
</div>
<div class="sc-glance-grid">
<article class="sc-glance-card">
<span class="sc-glance-num">01</span>
<strong>Some treatments may improve pain and function.</strong>
<p>Randomized evidence suggests possible benefit in selected patients, but results are mixed and depend on the exact product and protocol.</p>
</article>
<article class="sc-glance-card">
<span class="sc-glance-num">02</span>
<strong>Symptom relief is not cartilage regeneration.</strong>
<p>Routine injections have not been shown to reliably rebuild durable normal knee cartilage or reverse osteoarthritis.</p>
</article>
<article class="sc-glance-card">
<span class="sc-glance-num">03</span>
<strong>BMAC, PRP and expanded MSCs are not interchangeable.</strong>
<p>The biological product, processing and supporting evidence matter more than the umbrella term “regenerative medicine.”</p>
</article>
<article class="sc-glance-card">
<span class="sc-glance-num">04</span>
<strong>There is no universally proven “best” cell source or dose.</strong>
<p>A credible comparison starts with your diagnosis and the exact protocol, not a headline cell count or treatment label.</p>
</article>
</div>
</div>
</section>
